          {
            "text": "Rule 11: +2-7+7-2+1-8 = -7 — ✗",
            "audio": "Rule of eleven: plus two minus seven plus seven minus two plus one minus eight equals minus seven. Minus seven is NOT divisible by eleven — ✗!",
